{{also|Donderdag}}
==Dutch==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|nl|dum|donresdach}}, {{m|dum|donredach}}, from {{inh|nl|odt|*thonaresdag}}, from late {{der|nl|gem-pro|*Þunras dagaz||day of Thor}}. Equivalent to {{m|nl|Donar}} or {{compound|nl|donder|dag}}.

[[Donar]] (North Germanic: ''Thor'') was the [[Germanic]] god of the thunder.

